@startuml
title 适老化打车平台 - SOS紧急求助状态机 (SOS State Machine)

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFCDD2
  BorderColor #D32F2F
  FontSize 16
  FontName Arial
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
  BorderColor #F9A825
}

state "IDLE\n(待命)" as IDLE #E8F5E9
state "PRESS_DETECTED\n(检测到按压)" as PRESS_DETECTED #FFF3E0
state "COUNTDOWN\n(倒计时中)" as COUNTDOWN #FFE0B2
state "COUNTDOWN_CANCELLED\n(倒计时取消)" as CANCELLED #ECEFF1
state "DISPATCHING\n(调度中)" as DISPATCHING #FFCDD2
state "DISPATCHED\n(已调度)" as DISPATCHED #FFCDD2
state "RECORDING\n(录音中)" as RECORDING #FFCDD2
state "RESOLVED\n(已解除)" as RESOLVED #E8F5E9
state "FALSE_ALARM\n(误触发)" as FALSE_ALARM #ECEFF1

[*] --> IDLE

IDLE --> PRESS_DETECTED : 用户按下SOS按钮\n(onPressIn)
PRESS_DETECTED --> COUNTDOWN : 开始倒计时\n(3秒)
PRESS_DETECTED --> IDLE : 用户松开\n(不足触发时间)

COUNTDOWN --> COUNTDOWN : 倒计时中\n(每秒振动提醒)
COUNTDOWN --> COUNTDOWN_CANCELLED : 用户松开取消\n(onPressOut)
COUNTDOWN_CANCELLED --> IDLE : 重置状态

COUNTDOWN --> DISPATCHING : 倒计时结束\n(3秒到)

state DISPATCHING {
  [*] --> DIAL_EMERGENCY
  DIAL_EMERGENCY : 拨打110/120
  DIAL_EMERGENCY --> BROADCAST_LOCATION
  BROADCAST_LOCATION : 向亲友+平台\n广播实时位置
  BROADCAST_LOCATION --> START_RECORDING
  START_RECORDING : 启动行程录音
  START_RECORDING --> NOTIFY_FAMILY
  NOTIFY_FAMILY : 推送SOS通知给亲友
  NOTIFY_FAMILY --> [*]
}

DISPATCHING --> DISPATCHED : 调度完成
DISPATCHING --> DISPATCHED : 部分服务失败\n(降级: 仍通知亲友)

DISPATCHED --> RECORDING : 录音持续中
RECORDING --> RECORDING : 每30秒上传录音片段

DISPATCHED --> RESOLVED : 确认安全\n(用户/亲友/平台确认)
RECORDING --> RESOLVED : 确认安全\n(停止录音)

DISPATCHED --> FALSE_ALARM : 用户确认误触发\n(3分钟内)
FALSE_ALARM --> IDLE : 重置(记录日志)

RESOLVED --> [*]

note right of COUNTDOWN
  F8.1: 长按3秒触发
  防误触设计:
  - 非单击, 需长按
  - 每秒振动反馈
  - 松开即取消
  - 大字实时倒计时
end note

note right of DISPATCHING
  F8.2-F8.5:
  1. 拨打110/120
  2. 广播位置给亲友
  3. 启动行程录音
  4. 大字确认弹窗
  5. 平台客服介入
end note

note bottom of FALSE_ALARM
  误触发处理:
  - 3分钟内可取消
  - 记录误触发日志
  - 优化按钮位置/灵敏度
  - 不通知110/120(已拨需告知)
end note

@enduml